    <programlisting>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Godot<sp/>Gaze<sp/>(`v0.1.0`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Real-time,<sp/>on-device<sp/>eye-gaze<sp/>and<sp/>6-DoF<sp/>head-pose<sp/>tracking<sp/>GDExtension<sp/>for<sp/>**Godot<sp/>4**,<sp/>powered<sp/>by<sp/>**ONNX<sp/>Runtime**<sp/>and<sp/>physical<sp/>camera-to-display<sp/>ray<sp/>projection.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Key<sp/>Features</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**On-Device<sp/>ML<sp/>Pipeline<sp/>(No<sp/>External<sp/>Services)**:<sp/>Runs<sp/>face<sp/>detection<sp/>(`face_detection_yunet_2023mar.ort`),<sp/>35-point<sp/>facial<sp/>landmarks<sp/>(`facial-landmarks-35-adas-0002.ort`),<sp/>3D<sp/>gaze<sp/>estimation<sp/>(`gaze-estimation-adas-0002.ort`),<sp/>and<sp/>eye-openness<sp/>classification<sp/>(`open_closed_eye.ort`)<sp/>locally<sp/>via<sp/>ONNX<sp/>Runtime.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Physical<sp/>Camera-to-Display<sp/>Geometry**:<sp/>Solves<sp/>3D<sp/>head<sp/>pose<sp/>via<sp/>EPnP<sp/>in<sp/>millimeter<sp/>camera<sp/>space<sp/>and<sp/>intersects<sp/>the<sp/>fused<sp/>gaze<sp/>ray<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>physical<sp/>screen<sp/>plane,<sp/>converting<sp/>automatically<sp/>to<sp/>Godot<sp/>canvas<sp/>and<sp/>`CanvasItem`-local<sp/>coordinates<sp/>across<sp/>window<sp/>sizes<sp/>and<sp/>DPI<sp/>scales.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**First-Class<sp/>Godot<sp/>Input<sp/>Events**:<sp/>Dispatches<sp/>`InputEventGaze`<sp/>and<sp/>`InputEventGazeMissing`<sp/>through<sp/>Godot&apos;s<sp/>standard<sp/>`Input`<sp/>pipeline.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Reference-Counted<sp/>Lifecycle<sp/>(`GazeTracker`)**:<sp/>Automatically<sp/>starts/stops<sp/>camera<sp/>capture<sp/>and<sp/>inference<sp/>when<sp/>nodes<sp/>enter<sp/>or<sp/>leave<sp/>the<sp/>scene<sp/>tree.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Inertial<sp/>Dwell<sp/>Node<sp/>(`FillAccumulator`)**:<sp/>2nd-order<sp/>smooth<sp/>dwell/charge<sp/>accumulator<sp/>with<sp/>blink/micro-saccade<sp/>momentum<sp/>tolerance<sp/>and<sp/>distance-scaled<sp/>off-target<sp/>drain.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Mouse<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Gaze<sp/>Coexistence**:<sp/>Built-in<sp/>`MouseStillnessArbitrator`<sp/>and<sp/>bi-directional<sp/>mouse<sp/>emulation<sp/>(`emulate_mouse_from_gaze`,<sp/>`emulate_gaze_from_mouse`)<sp/>so<sp/>physical<sp/>mouse<sp/>input<sp/>takes<sp/>instant<sp/>priority<sp/>and<sp/>mouse-only<sp/>dev<sp/>machines<sp/>can<sp/>test<sp/>gaze<sp/>UIs<sp/>without<sp/>a<sp/>webcam.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Calibration<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Visual<sp/>Debugger**:<sp/>Interactive<sp/>`GazeCalibrationWizard`,<sp/>persistent<sp/>`GazeDeviceProfile`,<sp/>and<sp/>live<sp/>`debug_cam_feed.tscn`<sp/>camera<sp/>overlay.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Headless<sp/>CI<sp/>Testing<sp/>(`MockVisionServer`)**:<sp/>Deterministic<sp/>synthetic<sp/>camera/gaze<sp/>driver<sp/>for<sp/>automated<sp/>testing<sp/>without<sp/>hardware<sp/>webcams.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Cross-Platform**:<sp/>Windows,<sp/>macOS,<sp/>Linux,<sp/>Android,<sp/>iOS,<sp/>and<sp/>Web<sp/>(WebAssembly<sp/>+<sp/>`gaze_sidecar.js`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Installation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Option<sp/>1:<sp/>Prebuilt<sp/>Release<sp/>(`godot-gaze.zip`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Download<sp/>`godot-gaze.zip`<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>[GitHub<sp/>Releases](../../releases)<sp/>page.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Extract<sp/>it<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>root<sp/>of<sp/>your<sp/>Godot<sp/>project<sp/>so<sp/>that<sp/>`addons/godot-gaze/`<sp/>sits<sp/>inside<sp/>your<sp/>`res://`<sp/>directory<sp/>(`res://addons/godot-gaze/gaze.gdextension`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Open<sp/>your<sp/>project<sp/>in<sp/>Godot<sp/>4,<sp/>go<sp/>to<sp/>**Project<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Project<sp/>Settings<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Plugins**,<sp/>and<sp/>enable<sp/>**Godot<sp/>Gaze**.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Option<sp/>2:<sp/>Building<sp/>from<sp/>Source<sp/>(or<sp/>Symlinking<sp/>`project/addons/godot-gaze`)</highlight></codeline>
