<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Quick<sp/>Start</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>1.<sp/>Lifecycle<sp/>Management<sp/>with<sp/>`GazeTracker`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">By<sp/>default,<sp/>`gaze/general/autostart`<sp/>is<sp/>`true`,<sp/>so<sp/>tracking<sp/>starts<sp/>automatically<sp/>on<sp/>startup.<sp/>For<sp/>explicit<sp/>scene-scoped<sp/>tracking<sp/>(or<sp/>if<sp/>you<sp/>disable<sp/>`autostart`),<sp/>attach<sp/>a<sp/>`GazeTracker`<sp/>node<sp/>or<sp/>call<sp/>`GazeTracker.track_node(self)`.<sp/>When<sp/>all<sp/>active<sp/>`GazeTracker`<sp/>nodes<sp/>have<sp/>`enabled<sp/>=<sp/>false`<sp/>or<sp/>exit<sp/>the<sp/>tree,<sp/>`GazeServer`<sp/>releases<sp/>the<sp/>camera<sp/>automatically.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">extends<sp/>Control</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_ready()<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>#<sp/>Attach<sp/>a<sp/>reference-counted<sp/>GazeTracker<sp/>to<sp/>this<sp/>node&apos;s<sp/>lifetime</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>tracker<sp/>:=<sp/>GazeTracker.track_node(self)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>print(&quot;Tracking<sp/>active:<sp/>&quot;,<sp/>tracker.is_tracking_active())</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>print(&quot;Build:<sp/>&quot;,<sp/>GazeServer.get_build_info())<sp/>#<sp/>e.g.<sp/>&quot;godot-gaze<sp/>v0.1.0&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>2.<sp/>Handling<sp/>`InputEventGaze`<sp/>and<sp/>`InputEventGazeMissing`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`InputEventGaze`<sp/>and<sp/>`InputEventGazeMissing`<sp/>both<sp/>inherit<sp/>`InputEventGazeBase`<sp/>(`InputEventAction`),<sp/>so<sp/>they<sp/>flow<sp/>through<sp/>standard<sp/>`_input(event)`<sp/>/<sp/>`_unhandled_input(event)`<sp/>callbacks.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&gt;<sp/>**Important:**<sp/>Uninitialized<sp/>or<sp/>invalid<sp/>gaze<sp/>positions<sp/>are<sp/>represented<sp/>as<sp/>`Vector2(NAN,<sp/>NAN)`,<sp/>and<sp/>clamping<sp/>preserves<sp/>non-finite<sp/>values<sp/>rather<sp/>than<sp/>collapsing<sp/>them<sp/>to<sp/>`(0,<sp/>0)`.<sp/>Always<sp/>check<sp/>`pos.is_finite()`<sp/>before<sp/>consuming<sp/>gaze<sp/>coordinates.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">extends<sp/>Control</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">@onready<sp/>var<sp/>reticle:<sp/>Control<sp/>=<sp/>$Reticle</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_input(event:<sp/>InputEvent)<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>event<sp/>is<sp/>InputEventGaze:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>#<sp/>2D<sp/>canvas<sp/>coordinates<sp/>(or<sp/>pass<sp/>`self`<sp/>for<sp/>coordinates<sp/>local<sp/>to<sp/>this<sp/>Control)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>gaze_pos:<sp/>Vector2<sp/>=<sp/>event.get_eye_gaze(self,<sp/>InputEventGaze.CLAMPING_DEFAULT)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>gaze_pos.is_finite():</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>reticle.position<sp/>=<sp/>gaze_pos</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>reticle.visible<sp/>=<sp/>true</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>#<sp/>Optional<sp/>head<sp/>pose<sp/>projection<sp/>&amp;<sp/>continuous<sp/>eye<sp/>openness<sp/>[0.0<sp/>closed<sp/>..<sp/>1.0<sp/>open]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>nose_pos:<sp/>Vector2<sp/>=<sp/>event.get_nose_gaze(self)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>left_open:<sp/>float<sp/>=<sp/>event.left_eye_openness</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>right_open:<sp/>float<sp/>=<sp/>event.right_eye_openness</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>#<sp/>3D<sp/>transforms<sp/>in<sp/>camera-space<sp/>millimeters</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>_head_xform:<sp/>Transform3D<sp/>=<sp/>event.head_transform</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>_gaze_xform:<sp/>Transform3D<sp/>=<sp/>event.gaze_transform</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>elif<sp/>event<sp/>is<sp/>InputEventGazeMissing:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>reticle.visible<sp/>=<sp/>false</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>match<sp/>event.reason:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>InputEventGazeMissing.REASON_NO_FACE_DETECTED:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pass<sp/>#<sp/>No<sp/>face<sp/>in<sp/>camera<sp/>frame</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>InputEventGazeMissing.REASON_OCCLUDED:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pass<sp/>#<sp/>Eyes<sp/>occluded<sp/>/<sp/>blink</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>InputEventGazeMissing.REASON_OUT_OF_BOUNDS:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pass<sp/>#<sp/>Gaze<sp/>fell<sp/>outside<sp/>display<sp/>bounds</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>InputEventGazeMissing.REASON_SENSOR_INACTIVE:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pass<sp/>#<sp/>Camera/pipeline<sp/>inactive</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`InputEventGaze.ClampingMode`<sp/>options<sp/>for<sp/>`get_eye_gaze(local_to,<sp/>clamping)`<sp/>and<sp/>`get_nose_gaze(local_to,<sp/>clamping)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`InputEventGaze.CLAMPING_FREE`<sp/>(`0`):<sp/>Unclamped<sp/>viewport/canvas<sp/>coordinates<sp/>(may<sp/>fall<sp/>outside<sp/>the<sp/>window).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`InputEventGaze.CLAMPING_CLAMPED`<sp/>(`1`):<sp/>Clamped<sp/>to<sp/>viewport<sp/>bounds.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`InputEventGaze.CLAMPING_DEFAULT`<sp/>(`2`):<sp/>Uses<sp/>the<sp/>`gaze/pointing/default_clamping`<sp/>project<sp/>setting<sp/>(default<sp/>`true`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>3.<sp/>Inertial<sp/>Dwell<sp/>Interactions<sp/>(`FillAccumulator`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`FillAccumulator`<sp/>provides<sp/>a<sp/>2nd-order<sp/>damped<sp/>charge/drain<sp/>state<sp/>machine<sp/>for<sp/>gaze<sp/>buttons<sp/>and<sp/>dwell<sp/>targets<sp/>without<sp/>harsh<sp/>resets<sp/>during<sp/>blinks<sp/>or<sp/>micro-saccades:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">extends<sp/>Control</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">var<sp/>dwell:<sp/>FillAccumulator</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">var<sp/>reticle_canvas_pos<sp/>:=<sp/>Vector2(NAN,<sp/>NAN)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_ready()<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell<sp/>=<sp/>FillAccumulator.new()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.fill_sec<sp/>=<sp/>0.8</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.drain_sec<sp/>=<sp/>0.4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.error_doubling_distance<sp/>=<sp/>100.0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.process_callback<sp/>=<sp/>FillAccumulator.PROCESS_IDLE</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.filled.connect(_on_dwell_filled)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>add_child(dwell)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_input(event:<sp/>InputEvent)<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>event<sp/>is<sp/>InputEventGaze:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>pos:<sp/>Vector2<sp/>=<sp/>event.get_eye_gaze()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>pos.is_finite():</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>reticle_canvas_pos<sp/>=<sp/>pos</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_process(_delta:<sp/>float)<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>not<sp/>reticle_canvas_pos.is_finite():</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.target_error<sp/>=<sp/>200.0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>#<sp/>Signed<sp/>distance<sp/>outside<sp/>this<sp/>Control&apos;s<sp/>global<sp/>rect<sp/>(&lt;=<sp/>0<sp/>charges,<sp/>&gt;<sp/>0<sp/>drains)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>rect<sp/>:=<sp/>get_global_rect()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>clamped<sp/>:=<sp/>reticle_canvas_pos.clamp(rect.position,<sp/>rect.end)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.target_error<sp/>=<sp/>reticle_canvas_pos.distance_to(clamped)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>queue_redraw()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>_on_dwell_filled()<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>void:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>print(&quot;Activated<sp/>by<sp/>gaze<sp/>dwell!&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dwell.reset()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">You<sp/>can<sp/>also<sp/>step<sp/>manually<sp/>with<sp/>`dwell.process_callback<sp/>=<sp/>FillAccumulator.PROCESS_MANUAL`<sp/>and<sp/>call<sp/>`dwell.process_error_delta(error_px,<sp/>delta)`<sp/>or<sp/>`dwell.process_dwell_delta(is_active,<sp/>delta)`.<sp/>Signals<sp/>emitted:<sp/>`fill_changed(fill:<sp/>float)`,<sp/>`fill_started()`,<sp/>`filled()`,<sp/>`emptied()`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Mouse<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Gaze<sp/>Coexistence</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Gaze<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Mouse<sp/>(`gaze/pointing/emulate_mouse_from_gaze`,<sp/>default<sp/>`true`)**:<sp/>Drives<sp/>Godot&apos;s<sp/>pointer<sp/>position<sp/>from<sp/>gaze<sp/>when<sp/>the<sp/>physical<sp/>mouse<sp/>is<sp/>idle,<sp/>with<sp/>optional<sp/>dwell<sp/>clicks<sp/>(`gaze/pointing/mouse_emulation_dwell_sec`,<sp/>default<sp/>`1.5`s).<sp/>Moving<sp/>the<sp/>physical<sp/>mouse<sp/>outside<sp/>the<sp/>anchor<sp/>bubble<sp/>(`gaze/pointing/mouse_stillness_threshold_px`,<sp/>default<sp/>`3.0`<sp/>px)<sp/>immediately<sp/>returns<sp/>pointer<sp/>authority<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>mouse;<sp/>remaining<sp/>still<sp/>for<sp/>`gaze/pointing/mouse_stillness_duration_sec`<sp/>(`1.5`s)<sp/>blends<sp/>control<sp/>back<sp/>to<sp/>gaze<sp/>over<sp/>`gaze/pointing/mouse_emulation_transition_sec`<sp/>(`0.3`s).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Mouse<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Gaze<sp/>(`gaze/pointing/emulate_gaze_from_mouse`,<sp/>default<sp/>`true`)**:<sp/>When<sp/>no<sp/>face/webcam<sp/>feed<sp/>is<sp/>tracking,<sp/>mouse<sp/>movement<sp/>synthesizes<sp/>`InputEventGaze`<sp/>events<sp/>so<sp/>you<sp/>can<sp/>develop<sp/>and<sp/>test<sp/>gaze<sp/>interactions<sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>regular<sp/>mouse.<sp/>Inspect<sp/>runtime<sp/>authority<sp/>with<sp/>`GazeServer.is_physical_mouse_still()`,<sp/>`GazeServer.is_physical_mouse_active()`,<sp/>and<sp/>`GazeServer.is_mouse_emulated()`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Customizing<sp/>Events<sp/>(`GazeEventFactory`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">To<sp/>attach<sp/>domain<sp/>metadata<sp/>or<sp/>return<sp/>a<sp/>custom<sp/>subclass<sp/>of<sp/>`InputEventGaze`<sp/>/<sp/>`InputEventGazeMissing`,<sp/>extend<sp/>`GazeEventFactory`<sp/>and<sp/>override<sp/>`create_gaze_event()`<sp/>/<sp/>`create_missing_event(reason)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">extends<sp/>GazeEventFactory</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">class<sp/>AppGazeEvent<sp/>extends<sp/>InputEventGaze:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>tag:<sp/>String<sp/>=<sp/>&quot;&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>create_gaze_event()<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>InputEventGazeBase:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>base<sp/>:=<sp/>GazeServer.create_default_event()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>ev<sp/>:=<sp/>AppGazeEvent.new()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ev.copy_from(base)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ev.tag<sp/>=<sp/>&quot;gameplay&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>ev</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">func<sp/>create_missing_event(reason:<sp/>int)<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>InputEventGazeBase:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>GazeServer.create_default_missing_event(reason)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Register<sp/>your<sp/>factory<sp/>resource<sp/>via<sp/>**Project<sp/>Settings<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>`gaze/events/event_factory_path`**<sp/>or<sp/>dynamically<sp/>via<sp/>`GazeServer.set_event_factory(my_factory)`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Device<sp/>Calibration<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Visual<sp/>Debugging</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Device<sp/>Profiles<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Interactive<sp/>Calibration<sp/>Wizard</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Accurate<sp/>projection<sp/>relies<sp/>on<sp/>physical<sp/>display<sp/>pitch,<sp/>resolution,<sp/>and<sp/>camera<sp/>offset/tilt<sp/>represented<sp/>by<sp/>`GazeDeviceProfile`<sp/>(default<sp/>storage<sp/>path:<sp/>`user://calibrations/device_profile.cfg`<sp/>via<sp/>`gaze/calibration/device_profile_path`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Built-in<sp/>Wizard<sp/>Scene**:<sp/>Instantiate<sp/>`res://addons/godot-gaze/calibration/gaze_calibration_wizard.tscn`<sp/>(`GazeCalibrationWizard`),<sp/>connect<sp/>`wizard_completed(profile)`<sp/>/<sp/>`wizard_canceled()`,<sp/>and<sp/>call<sp/>`start_wizard()`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Programmatic<sp/>Configuration**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>var<sp/>profile<sp/>:=<sp/>GazeDeviceProfile.create_system_guess()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>profile.camera_offset_mm<sp/>=<sp/>Vector3(0.0,<sp/>12.0,<sp/>0.0)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>profile.camera_tilt_deg<sp/>=<sp/>-4.0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>GazeServer.set_device_profile(profile)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>profile.save_to_file(&quot;user://calibrations/device_profile.cfg&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Camera<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Landmark<sp/>Overlay<sp/>(`debug_cam_feed.tscn`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Instance<sp/>`res://addons/godot-gaze/debug_cam_feed.tscn`<sp/>(`DebugCamFeed`,<sp/>configured<sp/>by<sp/>`gaze/debug/overlay_scene_path`)<sp/>in<sp/>your<sp/>scene<sp/>to<sp/>visualize<sp/>the<sp/>live<sp/>BGR<sp/>camera<sp/>preview,<sp/>face<sp/>bounding<sp/>box,<sp/>35<sp/>facial<sp/>landmarks,<sp/>eye<sp/>crops,<sp/>and<sp/>stage<sp/>timings<sp/>(`GazeServer.get_pipeline_stage_timings()`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Headless<sp/>Testing<sp/>&amp;<sp/>CI<sp/>(`MockVisionServer`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>vision<sp/>driver<sp/>automatically<sp/>switches<sp/>to<sp/>`MockVisionServer`<sp/>when<sp/>any<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>following<sp/>is<sp/>true:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Godot<sp/>is<sp/>running<sp/>headless<sp/>(`DisplayServer`<sp/>name<sp/>is<sp/>`&quot;headless&quot;`),<sp/>e.g.,<sp/>`--headless`<sp/>unit<sp/>tests.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`--mock-camera`<sp/>or<sp/>`--mock-vision`<sp/>is<sp/>passed<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>command<sp/>line.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Environment<sp/>variable<sp/>`GAZE_VISION_DRIVER=mock`<sp/>is<sp/>set.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Project<sp/>setting<sp/>`gaze/vision/driver`<sp/>is<sp/>set<sp/>to<sp/>`&quot;mock&quot;`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>tests,<sp/>you<sp/>can<sp/>inject<sp/>synthetic<sp/>tracking<sp/>state<sp/>directly<sp/>into<sp/>`GazeServer`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```gdscript</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">GazeServer.set_face_pose(Vector3(0.0,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>500.0),<sp/>Vector3.ZERO,<sp/>true)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">GazeServer.set_gaze(Vector3(0.0,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>500.0),<sp/>Vector3(0.0,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>-1.0))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">GazeServer.set_eye_openness(0.95,<sp/>0.95)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">GazeServer.trigger_process()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Project<sp/>Settings<sp/>Reference</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">All<sp/>settings<sp/>are<sp/>registered<sp/>under<sp/>the<sp/>`gaze/`<sp/>namespace<sp/>in<sp/>**Project<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Project<sp/>Settings**<sp/>(`Advanced<sp/>Settings`<sp/>enabled):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Setting<sp/>Key<sp/>|<sp/>Type<sp/>|<sp/>Default<sp/>|<sp/>Description<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>:---<sp/>|<sp/>:---<sp/>|<sp/>:---<sp/>|<sp/>:---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`gaze/general/autostart`<sp/>|<sp/>`bool`<sp/>|<sp/>`true`<sp/>|<sp/>Automatically<sp/>start<sp/>gaze<sp/>tracking<sp/>when<sp/>the<sp/>engine<sp/>boots.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
