<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`gaze/pointing/default_clamping`<sp/>|<sp/>`bool`<sp/>|<sp/>`true`<sp/>|<sp/>Default<sp/>behavior<sp/>for<sp/>`InputEventGaze.CLAMPING_DEFAULT`.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
