<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`gaze/pointing/mouse_stillness_threshold_px`<sp/>|<sp/>`float`<sp/>|<sp/>`3.0`<sp/>|<sp/>Anchor<sp/>bubble<sp/>radius<sp/>(px)<sp/>above<sp/>which<sp/>physical<sp/>mouse<sp/>motion<sp/>claims<sp/>control.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
