<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Web<sp/>Export<sp/>Guidelines</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">When<sp/>exporting<sp/>a<sp/>project<sp/>to<sp/>**Web<sp/>(HTML5<sp/>/<sp/>WebAssembly)**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Enable<sp/>the<sp/>Godot<sp/>Gaze<sp/>Editor<sp/>Plugin**:<sp/>Activating<sp/>the<sp/>plugin<sp/>registers<sp/>`GodotGazeExportPlugin`,<sp/>which<sp/>automatically<sp/>copies<sp/>`res://addons/godot-gaze/bin/gaze_sidecar.js`<sp/>into<sp/>your<sp/>export<sp/>output<sp/>folder<sp/>alongside<sp/>the<sp/>HTML/JS<sp/>bundle.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Thread<sp/>Support<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Cross-Origin<sp/>Isolation<sp/>Headers**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>If<sp/>you<sp/>enable<sp/>**Thread<sp/>Support**<sp/>in<sp/>your<sp/>Godot<sp/>Web<sp/>export<sp/>preset,<sp/>browsers<sp/>require<sp/>`SharedArrayBuffer`<sp/>cross-origin<sp/>isolation.<sp/>Your<sp/>web<sp/>server<sp/>**must**<sp/>send:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>```http</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy:<sp/>same-origin</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy:<sp/>require-corp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>If<sp/>your<sp/>static<sp/>host<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>let<sp/>you<sp/>configure<sp/>custom<sp/>HTTP<sp/>headers,<sp/>**disable<sp/>Thread<sp/>Support**<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>Web<sp/>export<sp/>preset<sp/>so<sp/>Godot<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>single-threaded<sp/>`.wasm`<sp/>GDExtension<sp/>binary.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Web<sp/>Model<sp/>Assets**:<sp/>Web<sp/>exports<sp/>initialize<sp/>`gaze_sidecar.js`<sp/>(`onnxruntime-web`)<sp/>against<sp/>`res://models/face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx`<sp/>and<sp/>`res://models/gaze-estimation-adas-0002.onnx`.<sp/>Ensure<sp/>those<sp/>non-resource<sp/>model<sp/>files<sp/>are<sp/>included<sp/>in<sp/>your<sp/>Web<sp/>export<sp/>preset&apos;s<sp/>non-resource<sp/>file<sp/>filter<sp/>(`*.onnx,<sp/>*.ort`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
